Short: monitor OpenDevice() with SerFlags, v1.8
Author: Matthias Andree <m_andree@tribal.line.org>
Uploader: Matthias Andree <mandree@sx1.hrz.uni-dortmund.de>
Type: util/moni
Requires: OS 2.04+
Replaces: util/moni/WatchOpenDevice.*

Executables and texts are MD5SUMmed and PGP-signed
to allow for checking the integrity.

C source files are available upon request.



NEWS:
~~~~~
WatchOpenDevice checks if a copy is already running. If so, shows
requester and asks if you would like to remove the first copy also.

Thanks to Nils Görs <n.goers@art-line.de> for reporting this.

